{
  "slug": "humwork",
  "name": "Humwork",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time consultation with verified human domain experts (software, design, law, finance, medical, product). When your AI agent is stuck — after multiple failed approaches, on a high-stakes decision, or working in unfamiliar territory — Humwork matches it with a vetted human in under 60 seconds and feeds the expert's response back into your conversation. Five MCP tools cover the full session lifecycle: open, send messages, read replies, close, rate.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install humwork@claude-community` from `humworkai/humwork-mcp`.\n\nConnect AI agents with verified domain experts in real-time. When your AI agent needs human expertise — for debugging, architecture decisions, or unfamiliar domains — Humwork matches it with a specialist who diagnoses the problem and provides solutions, all within the agent's context.",
